# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This example uses `stretch` to ensure a sequence of gates between two barriers are left-aligned, whatever their actual durations are:\n"
msgstr "Contoh ini menggunakan `stretch` untuk memastikan urutan gate di antara dua barrier disejajarkan ke kiri, apapun durasi aktualnya:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\">\n"
msgstr "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\">\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid " When using `stretch` with Qiskit Runtime, any remainder resulting from a stretch resolution is added to the first delay that uses the stretch.\n"
msgid " When using `stretch` with IBM Quantum Compute Service, any remainder resulting from a stretch resolution is added to the first delay that uses the stretch.\n"
msgstr " Saat menggunakan `stretch` dengan Qiskit Runtime, sisa apapun yang dihasilkan dari resolusi stretch ditambahkan ke delay pertama yang menggunakan stretch tersebut.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example:\n"
msgstr "Contoh:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"    circuit.barrier(q0, q1)\n"
"    circuit.delay(100, q0)\n"
"    circuit.delay(a, q1)  # resolve to 26\n"
"    circuit.x(q1)  # duration: 8\n"
"    circuit.delay(a, q1)  # resolve to 25\n"
"    circuit.x(q1)  # duration: 8\n"
"    circuit.delay(a, q1)  # resolve to 25\n"
"    circuit.x(q1)  # duration: 8\n"
"    circuit.barrier(q0, q1)\n"
"     ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```python\n"
"    a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"    circuit.barrier(q0, q1)\n"
"    circuit.delay(100, q0)\n"
"    circuit.delay(a, q1)  # resolve to 26\n"
"    circuit.x(q1)  # duration: 8\n"
"    circuit.delay(a, q1)  # resolve to 25\n"
"    circuit.x(q1)  # duration: 8\n"
"    circuit.delay(a, q1)  # resolve to 25\n"
"    circuit.x(q1)  # duration: 8\n"
"    circuit.barrier(q0, q1)\n"
"     ```\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The above code resolves to a value of 25 with a remainder of 1. The first delay`[a]` will have the remainder added.\n"
msgstr "Kode di atas diselesaikan ke nilai 25 dengan sisa 1. Delay pertama `[a]` akan mendapat tambahan sisa tersebut.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Stretch resolution equation:  $a + 8 + a + 8 + a + 8 = 100   =   3*a + 24$\n"
msgstr "Persamaan resolusi stretch:  $a + 8 + a + 8 + a + 8 = 100   =   3*a + 24$\n"

